cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mathema in your research, please cite it as below."
title: mathema
abstract: >-
  A claim-driven development engine: state a claim about a function,
  have it adjudicated against the real implementation by symbolic
  proof or by executed sampling, and keep the record of what was
  established and how.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Byrne
    given-names: Aaron
    affiliation: Tetrion Ltd
repository-code: "https://github.com/tetrionlabs/mathema"
url: "https://mathema.tetrionlabs.com"
license-url: "https://github.com/tetrionlabs/mathema/blob/main/LICENSE.md"
version: 0.6.0
keywords:
  - claim-driven development
  - verification
  - property-based testing
  - symbolic mathematics
